%% alt: A question leads to a decision on corpus size, traffic, freshness and access rules: a small, stable, busy corpus can go whole into a cached prompt; a large, changing corpus with per-user access needs retrieval; mixed cases retrieve first and add whole documents when needed.
flowchart TB
  Q[Question]:::human --> D{Corpus size, traffic,<br/>freshness, access rules}:::control
  D -->|small, stable, busy| S[Stuff: whole corpus<br/>in the prompt, cached]:::model
  D -->|large, changing,<br/>per-user access| R[Retrieve: top passages<br/>into the prompt]:::tool
  D -->|mixed| H[Hybrid: retrieve first,<br/>stuff when needed]:::tool
